{title: Yield Not to Temptation}
{artist: Horatio Palmer}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[G]Yield not to temptation, for [C]yielding is [G]sin;
each victory will [A]help you some [D]other to win.
[G]Fight manfully onward, dark [C]passions sub[G]due —
look ever to [D]Jesus: he'll [G]carry you through.

Chorus
Ask the [C]Savior to [G]help you, [A]comfort, strengthen, and [D]keep you:
[G]he is willing to [C]aid [G]you — he will [D]carry you [G]through.
